1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","h2","0",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"The No-Code Landscape in Mid-2026: Top Sites, Latest Low-Code News, and Platform Recommendations"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The no-code movement has reached a critical inflection point in mid-2026. With the market projected to hit $65 billion annually (Gartner, June 2026) and over 2.3 million applications built on no-code platforms in the first half of this year alone, staying informed is more important than ever. This article rounds up the most authoritative no-code resources — ProductHunt's no-code collection, NoCode Tech, and other leading sites — and connects them with the latest low-code news to give you a complete picture of where the industry stands and where it's headed."]}],["$","h2","4",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Leading No-Code Reference Sites"}],["$","h3","6",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"1. ProductHunt — No-Code Collection"}],["$","p","7",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["ProductHunt remains the single best source for discovering new no-code tools as they launch. Its curated \"No-Code\" tag (producthunt.com/collections/no-code) features 3,200+ tools as of June 2026, with 180+ new launches per month. Notable mid-2026 launches include ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#e8e0f7]","children":"Flowmatic"}]," (AI-powered workflow builder that beat Retool in G2's \"Easiest Setup\" category) and ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#e8e0f7]","children":"Struct"}]," (visual database designer with native Notion sync). Key insight: 43% of ProductHunt's top 100 launches in Q2 2026 were no-code or low-code tools — up from 31% in Q2 2025."]}],["$","h3","9",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"2. NoCode Tech"}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["NoCode Tech (nocode.tech) is the industry's leading publication and community hub. Its mid-2026 coverage focuses heavily on three themes: (1) AI-native no-code platforms that generate full-stack apps from natural language descriptions, (2) enterprise governance tooling (audit trails, role-based access, compliance certifications), and (3) the rise of \"no-code for data engineering\" — visual ETL/ELT pipelines. Their Community Showcase section now features over 500 real-world case studies, including a municipal government in Sweden that rebuilt its citizen services portal entirely with Bubble (serving 150K+ residents)."]}],["$","h3","12",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"3. NoCode Hub"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["NoCode Hub (nocodehub.com), a massive directory cataloging 1,100+ tools across 30+ categories, continues to be the go-to resource for platform comparison. Their mid-2026 update added a new \"AI Agent Builders\" category featuring 47 tools. Notably, 72% of NoCode Hub's top-rated tools now integrate AI features, up from 34% in early 2025."]}],["$","h3","15",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"4. MakerPad"}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["MakerPad (makerpad.com) shifted its focus in 2026 from general no-code tutorials to \"No-Code Ops\" — teaching teams how to build internal infrastructure with no-code tools. Their latest cohort-based course (\"No-Code SaaS Builder — 2026 Edition\") saw 4,800 enrollments in Q2 alone, reflecting surging demand for structured no-code education."]}],"$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f"]}]
