1f:["$","h3","20",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"Bubble Launches \"Logic Graph\" v2"}]
20:["$","p","21",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["In April 2026, Bubble shipped its most significant update since 2024: Logic Graph v2. This visual workflow builder now supports parallel execution branches, real-time error debugging with breakpoints, and automatic TypeScript export. Early adopters report 35% faster workflow development compared to the previous node-based editor."]}]
21:["$","h3","23",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"Webflow Acquires \"Symphony\" AI Design Tool"}]
22:["$","p","24",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Webflow's acquisition of Symphony AI (May 2026) integrates a design-to-code engine that converts Figma frames into production-ready Webflow components with 94% accuracy. The feature is currently in beta and available to Business plan customers."]}]
23:["$","h3","26",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"Make.com Introduces AI Agent Builder"}]
24:["$","p","27",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Make (formerly Integromat) launched its AI Agent Builder in March 2026, enabling no-code creation of autonomous agents that can process emails, update CRMs, and generate reports — all triggered by natural language instructions. The feature is included in the Pro plan ($19/month)."]}]
25:["$","h3","29",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"FlutterFlow Crosses 1 Million Apps Built"}]
26:["$","p","30",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["FlutterFlow announced in June 2026 that over 1 million applications have been built on its platform. Their AI Gen feature (released Q1 2026) auto-generates fully typed Flutter apps from SQL schemas, reducing mobile app development time by 70% according to internal benchmarks."]}]
27:["$","h3","32",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#e8e0f7] mt-8 mb-3","children":"Open-Source No-Code Surge"}]
28:["$","p","33",{"className":"text-[#c4b5fd] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Frameworks like Lume (18.4K GitHub stars) and ToolJet (22K GitHub stars) are gaining significant traction, with combined deployments growing 220% year-over-year. These platforms let teams self-host visual builders with custom connectors, appealing to regulated industries like fintech and healthcare."]}]
